sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Clinician
    participant Enc as EncountersService
    participant Notes as ClinicalNotesService
    participant Dx as DiagnosesService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>Enc: Start encounter (patientId, visitId, providerId)
    Enc->>DB: Create Encounter (status IN_PROGRESS)
    Enc->>Audit: audit encounter.started
    Enc-->>Clin: Encounter open
    Clin->>Notes: Create/update ClinicalNote
    Notes->>DB: Create ClinicalNote + ClinicalNoteVersion
    Notes->>Audit: audit clinical_note.created/updated
    Clin->>Dx: Add diagnosis (code from CodingSystem/CodeConcept)
    Dx->>DB: Create Diagnosis linked to encounter/patient
    Dx->>Audit: audit diagnosis.added
    Clin->>Enc: Complete/disposition encounter
    Enc->>DB: Update Encounter status
    Enc->>Audit: audit encounter.completed
    Note over Notes: Notes versioned; audit logs append-only
    Note over Enc: Patient access logged via PatientAccessLog as appropriate
